---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ISO 22000 Suspension & Withdrawal Policy | Eurocert"
  description="Review the ISO 22000 suspension, withdrawal and scope-reduction policy, including circumstances, responsibilities and certification actions."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/food-certification/iso-22000/suspension-policy/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[45vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367673/eurocert/F5.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="ISO 22000"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">ISO 22000  -  Policy Document</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Policy for Suspending, Withdrawing or <span class="text-eurogold-400">Reducing Scope</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Policy governing the suspension, withdrawal, or reduction in scope of FSMS certification</p></div></section><section class="bg-[#f8fafc] border-b border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] heading-font uppercase tracking-widest"><a class="text-slate-400 hover:text-euro-600 transition" href="/">Home</a><i class="fas fa-chevron-right text-[7px] text-slate-300"></i><a class="text-slate-400 hover:text-euro-600 transition" href="/food-certification/iso-22000/">ISO 22000</a><i class="fas fa-chevron-right text-[7px] text-slate-300"></i><span class="text-euro-600 font-bold">Suspension / Withdrawal Policy</span></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">ISO 22000 Policy</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Policy for Suspending, Withdrawing or <span class="text-euro-600">Reducing the Scope of Certification</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The EISPL will suspend or withdraw the FSMS certification, or reduce in the scope of certification on the following ground by giving notice to the certified client.</p><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200"><div class="bg-[#030a16] px-8 py-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-pause-circle text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest">The FSMS Certification is <span class="text-eurogold-400">Suspended</span> if:</h3></div></div><div class="p-6 space-y-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">1</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">The certified client has persistently or seriously failed to meet requirements of the food safety management system in accordance with the international standard ISO 22000, and it&#x27;s the effectiveness in implementation;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">2</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">The certified client has not participated in the surveillance activities including on-site auditing at the required frequencies;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">3</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">The certified client has did not opted for renewal of certification or re-certification audit was not allow to conduct within time frame;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">4</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">The certified client has voluntarily requested a suspension.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">5</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">The certified client has not submitted corrections and corrective actions for any non conformities (NC) within the stipulated time, and/or resulting pending of review and acceptance of minor NC, review, acceptance and verification of major NC due to delay in submission of report by the certified client;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">6</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">Violations of contract by the certified client including outstanding dues on services provided by the EISPL;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">7</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">Incorrect/inappropriate use of certificate(s) and/or certification mark(s);</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">8</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">Result of investigation conducted on a complaint against a certified client.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200"><div class="bg-[#030a16] px-8 py-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-500/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-times-circle text-red-400 text-sm"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest">The Certification is <span class="text-red-400">Withdrawn</span> if:</h3></div></div><div class="p-6 space-y-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">1</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">Failure to resolve the issues that have resulted in suspension within the specified time frame;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">2</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">In case where reduction in scope has likely impact on the entire management system, reduction shall not be permitted and in that case, the certification is eventuality withdrawn.</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">3</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">The certified client wishes to cancel and sends formal notification;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">4</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">The certified client ceases to exist as a legal entity in its form as certified;</p></div></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200"><div class="bg-[#030a16] px-8 py-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-compress-arrows-alt text-amber-400 text-sm"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest">The Scope of Certification is <span class="text-amber-400">Reduced</span> if:</h3></div></div><div class="p-6 space-y-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">1</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">Failure to resolve those part(s) of issues that have resulted in suspension within the specified time frame;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">2</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1">If part(s) of the scope of certification has persistently or seriously failed to meet the certification requirements;</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-10 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-euro-600 hover:text-euro-700 transition" href="/food-certification/iso-22000/"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left text-[9px]"></i> Back to ISO 22000</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
